      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "To clarify: the alternative here is coordinates relative to either the player's playspace origin, or their head. Preferably their playspace origin - the playspace origin is the most useful reference space, which would pair nicely with the local anchor mode (which is also missing, as said)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
